                                                "sense_id": "f9f86f54-fbca-3e66-a127-08191eac413b",
                                                "text": "Deceased had already made a will in his favour before her marriage, but—and Mr. Philips wagged an expressive forefinger—the prisoner was not aware of that. What had induced the deceased to make a fresh will, with the old one still extant, he could not say."
